# SHA-256 of the vendored SDK client, checked by
# tests/test_generated_client_sync.py and .github/workflows/sdk-drift.yml.
#
# custom_components/goodvibes/generated_client.py is a byte-for-byte copy of the
# SDK's generated artifact. This repo does not run the SDK's code generator and CI
# has no SDK checkout, so this recorded hash is the only thing standing between a
# hand-edit of the vendored file and a shipped release.
