# Refresh it ONLY after re-copying the artifact from the SDK, never to make a
# failing check pass:
#   sha256sum custom_components/goodvibes/generated_client.py > tests/generated_client.sha256
# (then restore this comment header), and verify with:
#   sha256sum -c tests/generated_client.sha256

